WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:03.380
Open the hub. Choose Record.

00:00:03.380 --> 00:00:05.080
Turn on Video and GIF.

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:08.490
Choose Area. Drag over the game.

00:00:08.490 --> 00:00:12.090
Play the interaction while recording.

00:00:12.090 --> 00:00:13.880
Stop. The recording joins your request.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:17.130
Add a request. Save it as a mark.
